-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.3.47</span> </span>, etc.). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">IV</span> Adverbial usage of some cases: </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">1</span> <span class=\"gk\">τῇδε,</span> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">a</span> of Place, <b class=\"lex-tr\">here, on the spot,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.345</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.173</span> </span>, etc.; so <span class=\"gk\">τῶν τε ὑπὸ γῆς θεῶν καὶ τῶν τ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">958d</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">b</span> of Manner, <b class=\"lex-tr\">thus,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eu.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">45</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὅρα δὲ καὶ τ., ὅτι.. </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">79e</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">433e</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> acc. neut. <span class=\"gk\">τόδε</span> with <span class=\"gk\">ἱκάνω,</span> etc., <b class=\"lex-tr\">hither, to this spot,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.298</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.409</span> </span>, al.; also <span class=\"gk\">δεῦρο τόδε</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.309</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">17.444</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">524</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">b</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">therefore, on this account,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τόδε χώεο</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">23.213</span> </span>: so also acc. pl. neut., <span class=\"gk\">τάδε γηθήσειε</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">on this account,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.77</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> dat. pl. neut., <span class=\"gk\">τοισίδε</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">in</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">with these words,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τοισίδε ἀμείβεται</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.120</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοισίδε προέχει</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">in these respects,</b> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">32</span> </span>.</div></div>"}